    "upgradeability": "unknown",
    "about": "Solv Protocol is an on-chain Bitcoin reserve and liquid staking platform that allows BTC holders to mint SolvBTC (a 1:1 tokenized Bitcoin), deposit it into yield-bearing LSTs such as xSolvBTC (instant-redemption yield token) or strategy-specific vaults (SolvBTC.BERA, SolvBTC.ENA, SolvBTC.CORE, etc.), and deploy capital across DeFi on 20+ EVM-compatible chains. The BTC+ product acts as an allocation hub directing capital into structured yield strategies. Bitcoin backing is held by institutional custodians (including Ceffu/Binance Custody) with weekly proof-of-reserves attestations and monthly custodian attestations. Contract admin roles use Gnosis Safe multisig wallets unified across all chains, with audits completed by OpenZeppelin, Quantstamp, Salus, and Paladin."
